# vibe-trade V2 — three daily jobs + weekly report
# Timezone: Asia/Jerusalem (set host TZ or use timedatectl)
# Prereq: IB Gateway running on localhost:7497
#
# Install: crontab deploy/crontab.example
# Verify:  crontab -l
#
# RECORD TIMING — read before changing (corrected 2026-07-30):
# The US open is 16:30 Asia/Jerusalem (09:30 ET = 13:30 UTC; both zones are on
# summer time together for most of the year). Market orders placed at 16:00 fill
# AT the open, so their executions first appear in `ib.fills()` at ~16:30:0x.
#
# `record` reads `ib.fills()`. Running it at 16:25 — as this file said until
# 2026-07-30, and as ARCHITECTURE_V2.md still justified as "a 5-minute buffer
# before market open" — means it runs 5 minutes BEFORE any fill exists and
# records nothing. The live box has been on 16:35 all along, which is why it
# worked; the repo just never said so.
#
# 16:35 leaves 5 minutes of slack after the open. Reconcile at 23:30 back-fills
# anything record still misses (orphan BUY and orphan SELL recovery), so record
# is a fast-path, not the only path.
#
# DST caveat: Israel leaves summer time in late October, the US in early
# November. In that ~1-week gap the US open lands at 17:30 Israel time and even
# 16:35 is too early — record will no-op those days and reconcile will pick the
# fills up. Nothing breaks, but don't be surprised by it.

# Preflight — 10 minutes before submit. Verifies IB Gateway is up and logged in,
# the universe loads, and a strategy is enabled. Read-only. Telegrams on success
# AND failure, so silence (rather than a red message) is what should worry you.
# 10 minutes is enough to `systemctl restart ib-gateway` and re-run before 16:00.
# See ibgateway/README.md for the systemd + IBC setup that makes this rarely fire.
50 15 * * 1-5  cd /opt/vibe-trade/deploy && docker compose run --rm preflight >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1

00 16 * * 1-5  cd /opt/vibe-trade/deploy && docker compose run --rm submit   >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1
35 16 * * 1-5  cd /opt/vibe-trade/deploy && docker compose run --rm record   >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1
30 23 * * 1-5  cd /opt/vibe-trade/deploy && docker compose run --rm reconcile >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1

# Weekly report — Saturday 09:00. Renders reports/<date>-weekly.png + Telegram.
00 09 * * 6    cd /opt/vibe-trade/deploy && docker compose run --rm report-weekly >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1

# Daily DB backup — 23:45, after reconcile is done. Keeps 14 days.
# (See deploy/README.md "Database Backup" for the restore procedure.)
45 23 * * 1-5  mkdir -p /opt/vibe-trade/backups && docker run --rm -v deploy_vibe-data:/data -v /opt/vibe-trade/backups:/backup alpine sh -c 'cp /data/vibe_trade.db "/backup/vibe_trade-$(date +\%Y\%m\%d).db"' && find /opt/vibe-trade/backups -name 'vibe_trade-*.db' -mtime +14 -delete >> /opt/vibe-trade/deploy/logs/cron.log 2>&1
